{
  "name": "06 - Error Handler & Audit Log",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 06 \u00b7 Error Handler & Audit Log\n**Two entry points**\n1. *Error Trigger* \u2013 set as the Error Workflow of 01\u201305; any failed execution lands here.\n2. *When Called by Another Workflow* \u2013 01\u201305 send run events here.\n\n**Input contract** (sub-workflow): `workflow`, `event`, `level` (info|warning|error), `message`, `details`, `execution_id`.\n**Output**: one row per event in Data Table `audit_log`; `error` level also emails the admin.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 520
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -80,
        -420
      ],
      "id": "c5fb8fac-5226-4dd5-928f-16c030173d3c",
      "name": "Note ad2b85"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.errorTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "id": "65a56135-50cb-4e73-ad9d-772801da0ba0",
      "name": "Error Trigger"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Normalise n8n's Error Trigger payload into the audit-log contract\nconst e = $json.execution || {};\nconst wf = $json.workflow || {};\nconst err = e.error || $json.trigger?.error || {};\nreturn [{ json: {\n  workflow: wf.name || 'unknown workflow',\n  event: 'workflow_error',\n  level: 'error',\n  message: err.message || 'Unknown error',\n  details: JSON.stringify({\n    failed_node: e.lastNodeExecuted || err.node?.name || null,\n    mode: e.mode || null,\n    description: err.description || null,\n    stack: (err.stack || '').split('\\n').slice(0, 5).join('\\n')\n  }),\n  execution_id: e.id ? String(e.id) : '',\n  execution_url: e.url || ''\n}}];"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "id": "ba71a3e4-ffb1-431b-a209-15016a0fdcf6",
      "name": "Format Error Event"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        220
      ],
      "id": "571dafdf-5355-4a77-a2fb-0c36dbe40db9",
      "name": "When Called by Another Workflow"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Validate events sent by workflows 01\u201305; never throw so logging can't break callers\nconst LEVELS = ['info', 'warning', 'error'];\nreturn $input.all().map(({ json: j }) => ({ json: {\n  workflow: String(j.workflow || 'unknown workflow'),\n  event: String(j.event || 'event'),\n  level: LEVELS.includes(j.level) ? j.level : 'info',\n  message: String(j.message ?? '').slice(0, 1000),\n  details: typeof j.details === 'string' ? j.details : JSON.stringify(j.details ?? {}),\n  execution_id: j.execution_id != null ? String(j.execution_id) : '',\n  execution_url: j.execution_url || ''\n}}));"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        220
      ],
      "id": "88fc0650-455b-45fc-bfd9-20454078a26b",
      "name": "Normalize Log Event"
    },
